rip to Georgia, Vivian meets a group of refugee farmers growing greens that remind them of home.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wxgtjzzeu3yi9TzZWNFqgghK22P.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-24\",\"runtime\":53},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"How Do You 'Cue?\",\"overview\":\"Follow Vivian on a journey to learn how other Southerners cook and eat barbecue. She travels to Florida for smoked mullet and Texas for barbecue with Japanese and Mexican twists.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uw7wYfj5eHtR7vFvxmFDVH7WZ8R.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-05-01\",\"runtime\":53}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2020-03-27\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}